  "transcript": {
    "segments": [
      {
        "timestamp": "0:00",
        "text": "♪ Bass-heavy electronic music ♪ Ready for your day two briefing? Let's jump right in, shall we? First, we cooked up new ways to navigate within your SwiftUI apps."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:13",
        "text": "- This recipe is our pièce de résistance."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:15",
        "text": "Then we learned more about the new features in Xcode 14."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:19",
        "text": "- You can choose the level of detail that's right for you."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:22",
        "text": "And Jared showed us new plug-ins for adding Apple frameworks to your Unity game projects."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:27",
        "text": "- The Core Haptics Unity plug-in gives you the tools you need to add an entirely new level of immersion into your games."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:34",
        "text": "- And there's a brand-new way to do 3D scans with RoomPlan."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:38",
        "text": "- Apple has enabled powerful new ways for people to bring the world into their apps."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:43",
        "text": "And then Paul showed developers how they can use color to make SF Symbols even more expressive."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:49",
        "text": "And we introduced the new Push to Talk framework for iOS."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:51",
        "text": "- Hey Trevor."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:52",
        "text": "Are you ready to cover your WWDC slides? - Hey Kevin."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "0:56",
        "text": "I'll be ready in a few minutes. Can you hear me? Over."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "1:00",
        "text": "Here's some intel for tomorrow."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "1:02",
        "text": "♪ Developers, we'll be in contact."
      },
      {
        "timestamp": "1:16",
        "text": "♪"
      }
    ]
  },
